        "Description": "Luca Mannucci has everything our client desires: a carefree life on the Italian coast and, more importantly, Pasqualina Moretti by his side.\r\rOur client is convinced that Pasqualina only needs a little space before she finally notices him. Unfortunately, Luca occupies rather a lot of it.\r\rRemove him discreetly, 47. Pasqualina must believe this was a tragic loss—not the first step in a desperate courtship.",
